Value Required TIMESTAMP (\d{4}\s+\S+\s+\d+\s+\d{2}:\d{2}:\d{2})
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value Required FACILITY ([^-\s]+)
Value Required SEVERITY (\d+)
Value Required MNEMONIC ([^:]+)
Value MESSAGE (.*)

Start
  ^\s*${TIMESTAMP}\s+${HOSTNAME}\s+%${FACILITY}-${SEVERITY}-${MNEMONIC}:\s*${MESSAGE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
